## Origin

2026-10-06 - operator hard rule after XYZ Displays reported that the
MxD Summit 2026 booth graphics printed gold and black instead of navy
and white. Root cause: Pillow wrote CMYK as JPEG with two conflicting
inversion markers, and verification used forgiving readers and
in-memory proofs instead of a strict decode of the delivered file.
